andles stress, good weather assessment (technical), but we need to address nasty remarks. I will propose Candidate B, but highlight need to verify crew cooperation.\n\nThus public message: I propose Candidate B, referencing strengths and concerns, and note that we still need to discuss other candidates.\n\nProvide METADATA_JSON vote: Candidate B."}
